Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.02,0:00:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.74,0:00:47.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not strong enough\Nto beat him like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.46,0:00:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see that nice lady anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.12,0:00:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.38,0:00:54.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She couldn't have just vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.20,0:00:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was sitting right behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.92,0:00:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't even hear a scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.02,0:00:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'd he do to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.40,0:01:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where could she have gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.34,0:01:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll pull the wrap.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I recall, you said the\Nshampoo stings your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.96,0:01:13.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since it looks like\Nyou've got some in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.78,0:01:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to help you wash it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.42,0:01:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now this won't take long.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.30,0:01:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in the same room,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.50,0:01:34.34,SC Opening 2 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,953)}Seeking out...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.50,0:01:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're getting the light on the eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.30,0:01:38.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'll be with you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.54,0:01:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been a dream of a\Ndream. It's a strange!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.88,0:01:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that I've been so far
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.76,0:02:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.50,0:02:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.46,0:02:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.58,0:02:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.90,0:02:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The end of the world
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.40,0:02:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a Diego!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.09,0:03:08.06,Title 3,title,0,0,0,,{\fad(488,437)\pos(159,871)}Episode 33: Set's Alessi, Part 2
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.24,0:03:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having point-sized arms is\Ngonna wind up getting me killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.54,0:03:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if only these stupid arms\Nof mine were just a little longer,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.94,0:03:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be able to poke his eyes\Nout and make a run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.90,0:03:19.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, even in the face of death,\Nyou've got to pull the plug.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.68,0:03:21.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.08,0:03:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With your hair clogging\Nthe water's only exit,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.68,0:03:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it'll take even longer for\Nthe tub to completely drain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.78,0:03:34.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd say you'll have five,\Nmaybe ten minutes left.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.52,0:03:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may as well throw in the towel now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.62,0:03:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going down for a\Npermanent nap! Goodnight!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.64,0:03:46.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Horrid dreams, you little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.66,0:03:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.62,0:03:54.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How does it feel knowing that\Nyou're utterly helpless, vulnerable?
