Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.00,0:04:08.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.92,0:04:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.34,0:04:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be, but from the shape\Nand color it looks like...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.84,0:04:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.08,0:04:20.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one in their right mind would think of\Ndoing something so downright disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.88,0:04:27.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's undeniable!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.28,0:04:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The smell proves it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.38,0:04:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How foul!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.78,0:04:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You took a shit in the bathroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.20,0:04:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I'm not so helpless after\Nall, you creepy four-eyed asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.74,0:04:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you do something like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.18,0:04:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dear God!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.46,0:04:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't there a shred of\Nhuman decency in your body?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.58,0:04:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of hero would ever stoop\Nto doing something so disturbing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.30,0:04:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are a bad boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.08,0:04:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.38,0:04:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up and tell me what\Nyou did to that nice lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.92,0:04:59.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to know right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.86,0:05:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.90,0:05:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.24,0:05:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady, answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.98,0:05:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.02,0:05:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, lady!
