Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.70,0:05:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.90,0:05:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd be wise for both of us to\Nwatch where we step, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.58,0:05:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One wrong move and your lady friend is\Nlikely to be squashed underfoot. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.88,0:05:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.54,0:05:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.38,0:05:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.04,0:05:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.42,0:05:51.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone who's unfortunate enough\Nto come into contact with my stand
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.82,0:05:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,experiences time in reverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.96,0:05:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luckily for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.28,0:05:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you saw me coming and jumped away\Nfrom my shadow at the last second,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.76,0:06:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,buying yourself a few more years\Nthan your friend down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.46,0:06:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But she had the misfortune\Nof touching my shadow for
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.44,0:06:08.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Several seconds! This is the\Nreason she became a fetus.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.82,0:06:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's alive for the time being\Nbut if I'm being honest with
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.06,0:06:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you she won't last long outside\Nthe safety of her mother's womb?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.94,0:06:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what she gets.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.32,0:06:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She should have never tried to help\Na pathetic piece of trash like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.64,0:06:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a moron
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.68,0:06:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the worst kind\Nof person on this planet
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.20,0:06:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap, you've got to be\Nkidding me. I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.62,0:06:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oops, looks like you touched it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.08,0:06:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means you're going\Nto get even younger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.78,0:06:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This time,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.76,0:06:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll probably regress to a diminutive\Nfour-year-old version of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.52,0:06:54.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.72,0:06:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.84,0:07:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to hurry and beat this\Nguy, or the nice lady will...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.70,0:07:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate, she only has a\Nmatter of minutes before she dies!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.98,0:07:13.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to find a way to defeat this\NAlessi freak, and I've got to do it fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.88,0:07:19.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She took me in and fixed up all my wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.72,0:07:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was so caring.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.64,0:07:22.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.18,0:07:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's absolutely no time to waste!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.02,0:07:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get over here, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.00,0:07:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where exactly do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.28,0:07:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna get far\Ncradling a dying fetus!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.16,0:07:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's a fun idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.00,0:07:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's turn you into a fetus!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.54,0:07:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit, not this again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.22,0:07:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His dumb shadow keeps touching me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.70,0:07:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I'm getting even smaller! Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.66,0:07:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.02,0:07:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way in hell I'm gonna lose now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.42,0:08:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Judging from your appearance, Polnareff,\Nyou're about three years old now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.62,0:08:06.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before you know it, your intellect will\Nbe that of a three-year-old's as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.02,0:08:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Locking the door won't do\Nyou any good, little one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.98,0:08:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.50,0:08:34.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, the stupid bars\Nare too close together!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.88,0:08:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even a kid can't slip through.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.06,0:08:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I have to find a way to get out of here\Nor that freak show's gonna kill us both!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.80,0:08:43.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.52,0:08:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't cut them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.78,0:08:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is just too crude to be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.04,0:08:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see that your chariot\Nhas also become a toddler.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.78,0:08:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bars are too tough\Nfor its baby rapier.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.32,0:09:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet it's gotten slower, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.32,0:09:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready or not, here I come.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.24,0:09:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Polnareff, here comes Alessi.
