Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.68,0:09:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sh-he's gone! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.86,0:09:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.30,0:09:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.58,0:09:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just vanished!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.36,0:09:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe the little\Nspunk monkey found a way
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.98,0:09:43.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to slither through the bars in the window!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.12,0:09:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clever, Ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.44,0:09:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.74,0:09:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're trying to pull\Na fast one, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.46,0:09:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think if you trick me into believing\Nyou slipped through the window,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.82,0:09:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it'll distract me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.86,0:10:00.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be hiding somewhere,\Nwaiting to get the drop on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.68,0:10:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not bad, runt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.98,0:10:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite cunning indeed for\Na miserable little shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.14,0:10:10.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, come out, come\Nout, wherever you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.44,0:10:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so puny now, you could easily\Nbe hiding in that drawer over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.40,0:10:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's probably hiding\Nin the bucket or the drawer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.26,0:10:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe he's actually hiding\Nin that teddy bear by the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.20,0:10:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, where could he be?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.94,0:10:30.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a one in three chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.02,0:10:34.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if at all possible, I'd\Nlike to get him with one swing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.60,0:10:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll crack open his infantile\Nskull with this axe!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.70,0:10:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've decided you're tucking away\Nin that tattered old teddy bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.64,0:10:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But my second guess is this grandfather\Nclock, the perfect hiding spot for a coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.42,0:10:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.06,0:11:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then maybe he's...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.28,0:11:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hiding in this rusty bucket!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.24,0:11:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.80,0:11:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you are in the bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.62,0:11:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then how about the drawer?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.32,0:11:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.76,0:11:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he? Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.42,0:11:21.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.34,0:11:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.25,0:11:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.54,0:11:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gone! But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.80,0:11:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way he could\Nhave gotten out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.68,0:11:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The walls, floor, and\Nceiling are all stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.40,0:11:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if they were one centimeter\Nthick, Chariot couldn't break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.72,0:11:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And those bars are too narrow for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.82,0:11:38.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw it with my own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.56,0:11:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is insane. Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.86,0:11:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.24,0:11:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you were outsmarted by\Na toddler, huh? What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.78,0:11:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, Alessi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.00,0:12:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.70,0:12:05.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The goldfish just disappeared!
