Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.18,0:12:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but lucky for me, you're just\Nas stupid as you are creepy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.82,0:12:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter if Cherry is\Nstuck in his two-year-old form,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.64,0:12:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he can still skewer your face, dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.70,0:12:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.00,0:12:56.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.92,0:12:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bad boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.83,0:12:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bad boy! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.96,0:13:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get your ass back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.28,0:13:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honey! Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.64,0:13:06.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until you break your stand\Nspell, I'm gonna keep attacking!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.18,0:13:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bad boy! Bad boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.42,0:13:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're such a bad boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.34,0:13:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Evolve, that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.26,0:13:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that jerk dropped out the window!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.96,0:13:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bad boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.38,0:13:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a horrible boy!
