Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.44,0:13:29.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.47,0:13:28.51,SFXThe,7,0,0,0,,{=0}{\bord10.52\fscx126.18\fscy105.15\fade(255,0,255,-3050,-2900,-1420,80)\frz10.06\pos(401.79,806.76)}Zam {19323}
