Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.36,0:13:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he's here, then I'm done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.08,0:13:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd he find us? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.52,0:13:46.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone falling from a\Nwindow covered in blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.46,0:13:48.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't see that every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.74,0:13:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.92,0:13:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.08,0:13:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At times like this, the winner\Nis the one who stays calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.78,0:13:56.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just think about it, Alessi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.76,0:13:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro must be looking for the\Nadult version of Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.60,0:14:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has no clue who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.68,0:14:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do what I always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.36,0:14:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Play dumb until the last minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.04,0:14:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then attack him when he least expects it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.98,0:14:11.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.08,0:14:16.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My boss is going to be so very\Nangry with me when he finds out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.16,0:14:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There I was, cleaning the window, and\NI suddenly slipped and fell through!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.74,0:14:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.58,0:14:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.14,0:14:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am in so much trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.86,0:14:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there, you\Nfrizzy-haired freak show!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.82,0:14:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.06,0:14:33.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was his name again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.60,0:14:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, what was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.76,0:14:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's my chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.98,0:14:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was waiting for Polnareff to\Npoke his annoying little head out!
