Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.96,0:14:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mister, watch out for his shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.62,0:14:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.70,0:14:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.74,0:14:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I managed to touch Jojuro's shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.46,0:14:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.14,0:15:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Jotaro, how does it feel to be\Nplaced under the spell of my stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.86,0:15:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This feeling...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.96,0:15:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.54,0:15:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.72,0:15:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's turning into a kid just like I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.24,0:15:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.82,0:15:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard through the grapevine that you've\Nonly recently developed your stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.56,0:15:17.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star Platinum.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.64,0:15:22.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that means you didn't have the ability\Nto use your stand when you were a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.56,0:15:24.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now you're nothing but ordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.34,0:15:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, he's been turned into a little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.60,0:15:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like he can't be any\Nolder than a seven-year-old.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.38,0:15:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I'm the winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.80,0:15:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hope you're watching, Master Dio,\Nbecause I'm about to kill Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.90,0:15:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd better give me a good reward\Nfor everything I've come through.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.54,0:15:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Jotaro, it's time to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.80,0:15:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.46,0:15:55.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He decked him using only\Nhis little kid fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.64,0:15:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.30,0:16:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate me\Njust because I'm a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.90,0:16:12.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.08,0:16:16.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.00,0:16:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're seriously telling me that Chariot\Ncould kick ass even as a little kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.02,0:16:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew he was tough, but he was\Nthat strong as a kid? Bites!
