Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.12,0:16:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got off easy, friend,\Nbut I can fix that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.72,0:17:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maniple!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.64,0:17:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand, set,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.96,0:17:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God of Chaos and Storms,\NAlessi, 38 years old,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.68,0:17:14.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,single, and an unfortunate projectile,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.28,0:17:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out of commission!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.50,0:17:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was all of that a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.96,0:17:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This earring belongs to that boy. It\Nreally did happen. I don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.26,0:17:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but for some reason I couldn't move\Nmy body that's right I may not have
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.90,0:17:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,been able to move but I remember\Neverything That sweet little boy devoted
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.94,0:18:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,himself to protecting me and risked his\Nlife by fighting against a grown man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.96,0:18:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has such a brave and heroic heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.60,0:18:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, where did that boy go?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.94,0:18:08.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.94,0:18:11.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did my little knight run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.36,0:18:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.80,0:18:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.82,0:18:20.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never met such an\Namazing woman before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.70,0:18:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.04,0:18:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So genuine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.90,0:18:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a close one, but thankfully\NI'm back to my normal self.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.12,0:18:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if she's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.22,0:18:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to bother you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.46,0:18:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you didn't happen\Nto see a sweet little
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.60,0:18:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,boy leave my house in\Nsomething of a hurry,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.40,0:18:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.88,0:18:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has silver hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.14,0:18:49.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, it\Nlooks exactly like yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.70,0:19:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon me for asking, but\Nhave the two of us met before?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.00,0:19:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't see a kid come through.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.38,0:19:09.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry I couldn't help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.40,0:19:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.14,0:19:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.20,0:19:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.84,0:19:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you be...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.18,0:19:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that earring you're wearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.62,0:19:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The two of us have never met before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.42,0:19:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.18,0:19:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friend and I are travelers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.70,0:19:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, if you'll excuse us, there's\Nanother town we need to get to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.88,0:19:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.44,0:19:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was only a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.82,0:19:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.98,0:19:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a single word from you, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.54,0:19:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.44,0:20:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.62,0:20:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro and Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.76,0:20:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where in the world have\Nyou two slackers been?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.48,0:20:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.60,0:20:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar and Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.70,0:20:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many times have I told the two of\Nyou not to go wandering off on your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.74,0:20:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're in a position to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.44,0:20:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the ones who just disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.12,0:20:20.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.18,0:20:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we focus on\Ngetting something to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.98,0:20:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Hey, Iggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.40,0:20:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the hell have you been all day long?
