Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.92,0:20:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I take that for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.48,0:20:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks a million!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.02,0:20:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about time we're finally\Ngetting a bit of relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.10,0:20:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was quite the late breakfast but\NI suppose it couldn't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.98,0:20:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, since we've almost made it to Cairo,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.34,0:21:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's time we figured\Nout where Dio is hiding out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.38,0:21:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, we're doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.90,0:21:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will it appear?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.14,0:21:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.20,0:21:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But given that we're so close, the\Nresults should be more precise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.50,0:21:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.68,0:21:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
