Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.18,0:21:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.58,0:21:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there a problem over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.06,0:21:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.30,0:21:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mind your own business.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.84,0:21:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.54,0:21:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old man, tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.80,0:21:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.00,0:21:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.88,0:21:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.86,0:21:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's getting clearer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.68,0:21:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a good look!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.54,0:21:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you have it, gentlemen,\Nour final destination!
