Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.22,0:23:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who fell for the scam.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.02,0:23:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had just about enough of your games.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.94,0:23:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gambling is just like relationships.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.82,0:23:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one who cries loses.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.28,0:23:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he does anything that\Nseems suspicious, you can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.00,0:23:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're scared, exactly right,\NI'm going to bet my soul. Good.
